'''Einary's Emporium''' is a [[Location]] on {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}}.

{{ZoneText||Talk to &6Einary&f.|Discover unique winter-themed rewards.|Spend your hard-earned &dNorth Stars&f.}}

== Features ==
'''Einary's Emporium''' features one main attraction.

=== Einary ===
{{Main|Einary}}
{{NPCSprite|Einary}} is an [[NPC]] located on the ground floor of '''Einary's Emporium'''. They own a shop that the player can open, which features a {{Item|Reindeer Pet}}, Tier XII [[Minions]], the [[Snow Suit|Snow Suit Equipment]], {{Ench|Refrigerate I}}, {{Item|Magic Top Hat}}, {{Item|Winter Fragment}}s, {{Ench|Luck VI}}, {{Ench|Looting IV}}, and {{Ench|Scavenger IV}}. They also sell the {{Item|White Gift Talisman}} line, which is exclusive for purchase during the month of December.

== Trivia ==
*On the top floor of '''Einary's Emporium''', there is an {{Item|Abiphone X Blue}} on the floor.

